### MaterialLots — UPDATE PATCH, partial update (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compactado en pacas de 50 kg"
}

### MaterialLots — PATCH material of a lot with stock (expects 409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": 2
}
